@startuml RF41_Sequencia
title RF41 — Ganhar FAI Points em todos os jogos (FLAIR e Desafios) e ao criar esquemas e peças\nDiagrama de sequência — endpoints reais
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
actor "Usuário" as U
participant "Frontend\nflair / schemes / pieces" as FE
participant "FlairController" as FC
participant "FlairService" as FS
participant "SchemeController → SchemeService /\nWardrobeController → WardrobeService" as CS
participant "WardrobeEventListeners" as WL
participant "FaiPointsService" as FP
participant "RoomService\n(RoomLayoutAccess)" as RS
participant "NotificationService" as NS
participant "HighlightsController" as HC
participant "Frontend\npoints" as FEP
database "MySQL" as DB
== Jogos ==
U -> FE: Duelar contra @usuário ou a Casa
FE -> FC: POST /api/flair/duels {schemeId, opponent}
FC -> FS: duel(user, schemeId, opponent)
FS -> DB: INSERT partida + FLAIR Coins
FS -> FP: game(userId, "FLAIR_DUEL", matchId, outcome)
FP -> FP: award(GAME_PLAYED, ref FLAIR_DUEL:matchId)
opt outcome = WIN
  FP -> FP: award(GAME_WON, mesma ref)
end
FP --> FS: pontos lançados agora (0 se repetido ou no teto)
FS --> FE: 200 {outcome, coins, faiPoints}
FE -> U: selo "+N FAI Pts"
note over FC, FS: o mesmo game() é chamado por POST /api/flair/arena,\nPOST /api/flair/teams/battles, /api/flair/modes/* (FlairModesService)\ne POST /api/challenges/{id}/entries (ChallengeService.submitEntry)
== Criações ==
U -> FE: Salvar novo esquema / cadastrar peça
FE -> CS: POST /api/schemes · POST /api/pieces
CS ->> WL: SchemeSaved / PieceCreated (AFTER_COMMIT)
WL -> FP: award(SCHEME_CREATED | PIECE_CATALOGED, ...)
== award() ==
FP -> DB: SELECT fai_points_rules WHERE action_code
FP -> DB: existsByIdempotencyKey(usuário:ação:ref)
FP -> DB: countByUserIdAndActionCodeAndCreatedAtAfter (teto)
alt sem regra / já pontuado / teto atingido
  FP --> WL: Award(granted=false)
else paga
  FP -> DB: INSERT fai_points_ledger
  opt subiu de nível
    FP -> RS: setLevel(userId, level)
    RS -> DB: UPDATE room_layouts.level
    FP -> NS: notify(ROOM_LEVEL_UP)
  end
end
== Consulta ==
U -> FEP: Abre Pontos
FEP -> HC: GET /api/me/points
HC -> FP: account(user)
FP -> DB: balance / lifetime / extrato / regras
FP --> FEP: 200 {balance, lifetime, level, nextLevel, levels, ledger, rules}
@enduml
